    "topic": "**BIO** (Bao I/O): the RISC-V based I/O coprocessor from bunnie's Baochip-1x, and work on improving it, such as Mike Bell's FemtoRV based rewrite.\n\n**Docs**\n• [BIO: The Bao I/O Coprocessor](https://www.bunniestudios.com/blog/2026/bio-the-bao-i-o-coprocessor/): bunnie's write-up\n• [Baochip](https://baochip.com/): chip, docs, tools and hardware\n**Source**\n• [baochip-1x](https://github.com/baochip/baochip-1x): the chip source\n• [bio-sim](https://github.com/baochip/bio-sim): RTL simulation of the BIO CPU\n• [bio-loader](https://github.com/baochip/bio-loader): load BIO code onto a Dabao board"
  },
